--
--   **Contents.** It holds 15 declarations of OpenAI's Lean: 7 definitions, 4 instances and 4 theorems. The definitions and types are `OAI.TraceReconstruction.sourceDepth`, `OAI.TraceReconstruction.sourceFitTail`, `OAI.TraceReconstruction.sourceGapFloor`, `OAI.TraceReconstruction.sourceInitialOffset`, `OAI.TraceReconstruction.sourceInitialWeight`, `OAI.TraceReconstruction.sourceScaleInverseEnvelope`, `OAI.TraceReconstruction.workingDeletion`.
